  "steps": [
    "Soak the poppy seeds, black mustard seeds, yellow mustard seeds and cashews in warm water for 15 minutes.",
    "Add the soaked ingredients to a blender along with grated coconut and a little water. Blend into a smooth paste.",
    "Transfer the paste to a bowl and mix in the Greek yogurt, turmeric powder and salt until well combined.",
    "Add the paneer cubes, green chillies and mustard oil. Mix everything gently until the paneer is nicely coated.",
    "Line a steel container with a banana leaf, transfer the paneer mixture into it and close the lid.",
    "Steam for 20 minutes until cooked. Serve hot with steamed rice and enjoy!"
  ],
